OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy at
OL,9,Ftimes. Feeling very warm and locally
OL,10,Fhot particularly across southeast
OL,11,FWales.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,16,FStaying warm in urban areas with light
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
