OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,6,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,7,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light, but a
OL,8,Flittle brisker near some coasts.
OL,9,FFeeling very warm, locally hot across
OL,10,Feastern areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,13,Fa fresher and cloudier from Friday
OL,14,Fwith perhaps the odd shower by
OL,15,FSaturday, and a spell of more
OL,16,Forganised rain arriving into the west
OL,17,Flate Sunday evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
